  "user_request_original": "Design a periodic multilayer dielectric stack on silicon substrate with air incidence. Stack structure: air | (hfo2 | SiO2 (Kischkat))_6 | si, exactly 12 layers total. Optimize individual layer thicknesses for all 12 layers, initialized at quarter-wave optical thickness for 10500 nm center wavelength. Target: maximize emissivity in 8000-13000 nm band, minimize emissivity in 3000-5000 nm band. Wavelength range for evaluation: 3000-13000 nm. Polarization: unpolarized (average TE and TM). Incidence angle: 0 degrees (normal). Material refractive indices from catalog datasets for hfo2, SiO2 (Kischkat), and si. Total layer count fixed at 12.",
